Keeps this directory in git.

phpunit.xml declares a `Unit` test suite pointing here, and git does not track
empty directories — so without this file a fresh clone has no tests/Unit, and
Pest exits 2 with "Test directory not found" before running anything. Which is
exactly what CI did.

Every PHP test in this project is currently a feature test: they all exercise
HTTP, the container or the database. This slot stays declared so that a unit
test added later runs without anybody having to remember to re-register the
suite.
